{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0066","name":"李牧","evidence":["zhuge-q-p055"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-p055-zhuge-p0066","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p055"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhuge-q-p055","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-bb98d1ff8c6148865f3b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“樊建为给事中，晋武帝问诸葛亮之治国。建对曰：‘闻恶必改，而不矜过；赏罚之信，足感神明。’帝曰：‘善哉！使我得此人以自辅，岂有今日之劳乎？’建稽首曰：‘臣窃闻天下之论，皆谓邓艾见枉，陛下知而不理；此岂冯唐之所谓“虽得颇、牧而不能用”者乎！’帝笑曰：‘吾方欲明之，卿言起我意。’于是发诏（治）〔理〕艾焉。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e9dee84ff5b911a43efe","start":0,"end":163}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
